# StatusConflict finding route
:expect-pins 2

# The exact StatusConflict finding route reaches its typed reader duty.
? obliged(Appeals, ReadStatusConflictFindingDuty, ReadStatusConflictFindingStandard).
# => TRUE

# The wrong recipient gains no StatusConflict reader duty.
? obliged(WrongStatusConflictReader, ReadStatusConflictFindingDuty, ReadStatusConflictFindingStandard).
# => FALSE
